ing clothes after finishing. (2 marks)\n9. Mention three demerits of misusing cosmetics. (3 marks)\n10. Give two reasons for softening water for laundry work. (2 marks)\n11. Give three functions of a lampshade in a living room (3 marks)\n12. Mention four methods of neatening seams (2 marks)\n13. State two undesirable properties of cotton. (2 marks)\n14. Why are some household articles and clothes starched? (2 marks)\n15. Explain the action of soap as a cleaning agent. (3 marks)\n16. State three ways in which a lactating mother would improve supply of breast milk to her\n baby. (3 marks)\n SECTION B (20 marks) Compulsory\n17. Your aunt has requested you to assist her in household chores during the August holiday.\n (a) Describe how to launder her woolen cardigan. (10 marks)\n (b) Explain how you would thoroughly clean your black leather shoes. (6 marks)\n (c) Outline how you would thorough clean an enamel serving dish (4 marks)\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………\n………………………………………………